### Priority order

| Priority | Test | Reason |
|----------|------|--------|
| 🔴 High | BM25 regression guard (non-Map input) | Documents original silent failure mode |
| 🔴 High | BM25 still builds when LadybugDB throws | Covers the catch branch, critical fallback |
| 🟡 Medium | `getQueryRows` — getAllRows throws propagates | Error visibility for query failures |
| 🟡 Medium | Highlight clear — negative case (toggle-on path) | Guards against scope creep in the handler |
| 🟡 Medium | `setProgress(null)` in error path | Stale UI state regression |
