### Issues

#### 1. Stale closure anti-pattern — `MarkdownRenderer.tsx:179`

```tsx
// MarkdownRenderer.tsx:103
const markdownComponents = React.useMemo(() => ({
    a: ({ href, children, ...props }: any) => {
        // ...calls handleLinkClick which closes over onLinkClick...
        onClick={(e) => handleLinkClick(e, hrefStr)}
    },
    // ...
}), [onLinkClick]); // "Removed handleLinkClick dependency as it is defined inside component but depends on onLinkClick"
```

The comment's reasoning is backwards. `handleLinkClick` is **not** in the dep array, but the memoized component tree captures it at the time of the last `onLinkClick` change. This works today because `handleLinkClick` only uses `onLinkClick`, making them equivalent deps. But it's a latent bug: if `handleLinkClick` ever captures additional state (e.g., a ref, a setting), that change won't invalidate the memoized component and the stale value will silently be used.

The correct fix is either: (a) add `handleLinkClick` to deps (it should be wrapped in `useCallback([onLinkClick])` first), or (b) inline `onLinkClick` directly inside `markdownComponents` and remove `handleLinkClick`. [Fix this →](https://claude.ai/code?q=In%20gitnexus-web%2Fsrc%2Fcomponents%2FMarkdownRenderer.tsx%20on%20branch%20perf%2Fweb-o1-lookups-memo-bundle%2C%20handleLinkClick%20is%20defined%20as%20a%20plain%20function%20(not%20useCallback)%20but%20is%20used%20inside%20a%20useMemo%20with%20dep%20array%20%5BonLinkClick%5D.%20Wrap%20handleLinkClick%20in%20useCallback(%5BonLinkClick%5D)%20and%20add%20it%20to%20the%20markdownComponents%20useMemo%20dep%20array%20to%20fix%20the%20stale%20closure.&repo=abhigyanpatwari/GitNexus)

---

#### 2. `sigmaRef` in `useEffect` deps — `GraphCanvas.tsx:157`

```tsx
// GraphCanvas.tsx:148
useEffect(() => {
    const sigma = sigmaRef.current;
    // ...
}, [visibleLabels, depthFilter, appSelectedNode, sigmaRef]);
```

`sigmaRef` is a `MutableRefObject` — its identity never changes, so listing it as a dep is a misleading no-op. React doesn't track `.current` mutations, only the ref object itself. Remove `sigmaRef` from this dep array. [Fix this →](https://claude.ai/code?q=In%20gitnexus-web%2Fsrc%2Fcomponents%2FGraphCanvas.tsx%20on%20branch%20perf%2Fweb-o1-lookups-memo-bundle%2C%20the%20useEffect%20at%20line%20148%20lists%20sigmaRef%20in%20its%20dependency%20array.%20sigmaRef%20is%20a%20MutableRefObject%20whose%20identity%20never%20changes%2C%20so%20this%20dep%20is%20a%20misleading%20no-op.%20Remove%20sigmaRef%20from%20the%20dependency%20array.&repo=abhigyanpatwari/GitNexus)

